<title>CHINA: Trading in Indesen Ind shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Indesen Ind shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of video cassette manufacturer Indesen Industries Co Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The company's shares gained HK$0.10 to end at HK$1.82 each on Wednesday. Volume was 87.67 million shares worth HK$166.09 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
